course: dictionary
lesson: 13161
title: Formulated
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Formulated is a word with a main meaning and a few special meanings in science and maths. Its main meaning is carefully thought out and put into words or a plan: «She formulated a clear plan to tidy the classroom.» She did not just tidy quickly. She thought about the steps first.
explain: In science, formulated means made according to a special recipe or formula. «This sunscreen is formulated for sensitive skin.» The makers mixed the ingredients in a careful, exact way so the cream is made for a purpose.
explain: Look at the words around formulated. Clues like plan, careful, recipe or equation point to its meaning. Then swap your meaning into the sentence to check it still makes sense.
fact: Formulated is the past form of the verb formulate: formulate, formulates, formulated, formulating.
fact: «Formulated» can also be an adjective, as in «a well-formulated question», which is clearly and carefully put together.
fact: In science, formulated means made according to a special recipe or formula.
fact: In maths, a rule or problem formulated as an equation is written in mathematical form.
fact: Phrases to remember: «carefully formulated», «well-formulated», «formulated for».
exercise: «The team formulated a plan to win the match.» What does formulated mean? | Broken into pieces | Lost on purpose | Painted in bright colours | *Carefully thought out and put into a plan
exercise: «This lotion is specially formulated for babies.» What does formulated suggest here? | Sent by post | Cheap and old | *Made to a special recipe for a purpose | Left out in the rain
exercise: In maths, «the rule was formulated as an equation». What does this mean? | Drawn as a picture | Said out loud | *Written in mathematical form | Hidden in a box
test: «Her question was well-formulated, so the teacher answered it at once.» What does well-formulated mean? | Too long to read | Written in another language | Written in a messy hurry | *Clearly and carefully put together
test: Which phrase means a product was made to a special recipe for a purpose? | Formulated backwards | Formulating a bag | Formulate the rain | *Formulated for
exam: «The scientists formulated a new theory after many careful tests.» Which word is closest in meaning to formulated? | *Developed carefully | Forgot | Broke | Dropped
